OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 250 Labradors gather at
OL,4,AClarkson's pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeremy Clarkson's pub has hosted its
OL,7,Fsecond Labrador meet-up, welcoming more
OL,8,Fthan 250 dogs and their owners.
OL,10,FThe Farmer's Dog, in Asthall, near
OL,11,FBurford in Oxfordshire, hosted the
OL,12,Fanimals and more than 600 people,
OL,13,Fincluding Clarkson's partner Lisa
OL,14,FHogan, for its second Red Fox Labrador
OL,15,Fgathering on Saturday.
OL,17,FThe pub's Oliver Aucamp said it was
OL,18,F"thoroughly memorable", adding: "We can
OL,19,Fsafely say that we've never seen so
OL,20,Fmany wagging tails all on one day."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
