OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 250 Labradors gather at
OL,4,AClarkson's pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Michael Singer said while
OL,7,F"the whole thing started as a bit of a
OL,8,Fjoke really" the proceeds would support
OL,9,Fcharities, including Shout's 24/7 text
OL,10,Fservice dedicated to farmers' mental
OL,11,Fhealth.
